                "entry_id": "b357eee4-1d4c-3aac-b41f-b451b1dd1d7a",
                "word": "воистину",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9ed85769-f419-3f4c-ae36-fb1e3bbb35a9",
                        "entry_id": "b357eee4-1d4c-3aac-b41f-b451b1dd1d7a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар., высок. в самом деле, действительно, подлинно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5cd3f11d-f7bb-455b-aa15-34b554bc152a",
                                "sense_id": "9ed85769-f419-3f4c-ae36-fb1e3bbb35a9",
                                "text": "Даже на жене Кузьмы, этой воистину глупой бабе, отразилось загадочное настроение Кузьмы."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f50e2848-110e-486c-8350-885ee79e7613",
                                "sense_id": "9ed85769-f419-3f4c-ae36-fb1e3bbb35a9",
                                "text": "Воистину: человек сложен, а поступки его примитивны."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1341073c-3feb-4e82-abfc-9548fa1399f1",
                        "source_entry_id": "b357eee4-1d4c-3aac-b41f-b451b1dd1d7a",
                        "source_sense_id": "9ed85769-f419-3f4c-ae36-fb1e3bbb35a9",
                        "target_lang_word": "truly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "truly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af5d81d9-34dc-35d8-b49c-058e04ba84bf",
                                        "entry_id": "cd194688-9c67-32c9-b62d-13e8e9a8c370",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In accordance with the facts; truthfully, accurately."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9dc5354c-d4ed-4096-ba05-4f3495fb3ba0",
                                                "sense_id": "af5d81d9-34dc-35d8-b49c-058e04ba84bf",
                                                "text": "He adds, very truly, that what was fatal to such philosophies as his was not Christianity but the Copernican theory."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b58bc59a-c623-3b8b-b7f0-b473f8b1ce2e",
                                        "entry_id": "cd194688-9c67-32c9-b62d-13e8e9a8c370",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Honestly, genuinely, in fact, really."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "modal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27b21dcd-a0e7-4e0a-b486-12ef8e9041f7",
                                                "sense_id": "b58bc59a-c623-3b8b-b7f0-b473f8b1ce2e",
                                                "text": "That is truly all I know."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a3366fe-aec5-4d4c-a483-2e1e3882bcc0",
                                                "sense_id": "b58bc59a-c623-3b8b-b7f0-b473f8b1ce2e",
                                                "text": "Truly, that is all I know."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3b49814c-7d96-3d6b-ad4c-eeccf7fdb94a",
                                        "entry_id": "cd194688-9c67-32c9-b62d-13e8e9a8c370",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ca53d8b-438e-4811-8f30-6313344a18ba",
                                                "sense_id": "3b49814c-7d96-3d6b-ad4c-eeccf7fdb94a",
                                                "text": "You are truly silly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ad9062e-7f14-4f5b-8635-642cde38cd75",
                                                "sense_id": "3b49814c-7d96-3d6b-ad4c-eeccf7fdb94a",
                                                "text": "I’m distantly related to the truly great writer, Chaim Potok, which for a magazine editor seems like a good thing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8c7012da-cbfd-4282-b4b9-2ac8d9368fdc",
                        "source_entry_id": "b357eee4-1d4c-3aac-b41f-b451b1dd1d7a",
                        "source_sense_id": "9ed85769-f419-3f4c-ae36-fb1e3bbb35a9",
                        "target_lang_word": "in truth",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "in truth",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b936ca3-c418-35d2-a937-aed9a5bb7b34",
                                        "entry_id": "879ffd1d-3b37-38c0-800d-626b134cda22",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Truthfully, to tell the truth, in fact."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46f09934-2cda-43ac-8d4d-f777bcf4de95",
                                                "sense_id": "6b936ca3-c418-35d2-a937-aed9a5bb7b34",
                                                "text": "I swear in all truth that I never knew about her crimes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "154a949d-ba42-4f25-a1c4-6c1adc900c24",
                                                "sense_id": "6b936ca3-c418-35d2-a937-aed9a5bb7b34",
                                                "text": "So this was my future home, I thought![…]Backed by towering hills, the but faintly discernible purple line of the French boundary off to the southwest, a sky of palest Gobelin flecked with fat, fleecy little clouds, it in truth looked a dear little city; the city of one's dreams."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1510778d-c241-41fe-b731-3bb8a35346d6",
                                                "sense_id": "6b936ca3-c418-35d2-a937-aed9a5bb7b34",
                                                "text": "In truth, Tottenham never really looked like taking all three points and this defeat means they face a battle to reach the knockout stages -with their next home game against PAOK Salonika on 30 November likely to prove decisive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0a41ead-e2d2-423b-94a9-630471db8e64",
                                                "sense_id": "6b936ca3-c418-35d2-a937-aed9a5bb7b34",
                                                "text": "In truth, I suspect it will take more than the first term of a Labour government to address the shortcomings of the railway system in the North."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
